Third-party components
----------------------

This product bundles third-party open-source software under its own terms.
The authoritative, in-app list is generated at runtime from every bundled
library and is available under Settings > Legal > Open-Source Licenses.

The statically linked non-Dart components, which no package manager tracks,
are:

  * rclone          - MIT License
                      Copyright (C) 2012 Nick Craig-Wood and contributors
                      https://rclone.org
  * golang.org/x/mobile (gomobile)
                    - BSD 3-Clause License
                      Copyright 2014 The Go Authors

"rclone" is a project of Nick Craig-Wood and the rclone contributors.
Fibu is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or sponsored by the rclone project.
